# Godot script/scene/data sources must stay LF on every checkout. A CRLF
# working copy turns the newline inside a GDScript multiline string literal
# into \r\n; Label renders the \r as an extra line break the height math
# never counted, and card text walks out of its card (2026-08-28 landscape
# QA false-positive — both QA worktrees were autocrlf checkouts).
*.gd text eol=lf
*.tscn text eol=lf
*.tres text eol=lf
*.godot text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.cfg text eol=lf
*.import text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf

# Binary art and audio never get eol treatment.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.ttf binary
